bds 1,0 "Data link capability report"
date 2026-10-14
preamble
    Data link capability report of the transponder.
    Source: ICAO Doc 9871 Table A-2-16.

items

    BDSID "BDS Identifier"
        definition
            BDS register identifier, fixed 0x10.
        element 8
            unsigned integer

    CONT "Continuation Flag"
        definition
            Continuation flag.
        element 1
            table
                0: No continuation
                1: Continuation follows

    spare 5

    OVC "Overlay Command Capability"
        definition
            Overlay command capability.
        element 1
            table
                0: No overlay command capability
                1: Overlay command capable

    ACASOP "ACAS Operational"
        definition
            ACAS operational indicator.
        element 1
            table
                0: ACAS not operational
                1: ACAS operational

    SUBNET "Mode S Subnetwork Version"
        definition
            Mode S subnetwork version number.
        element 7
            unsigned integer

    LVL5 "Transponder Level 5"
        definition
            Level 5 transponder (enhanced protocol) capability.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not level 5 capable
                1: Level 5 capable

    MSS "Mode S Specific Services"
        definition
            Mode S specific services capability.
        element 1
            table
                0: No specific services capability
                1: Specific services capable

    ELMUP "Uplink ELM Throughput"
        definition
            Uplink ELM throughput capability.
        element 3
            unsigned integer

    ELMDOWN "Downlink ELM Throughput"
        definition
            Downlink ELM throughput capability.
        element 4
            unsigned integer

    AIDCAP "Aircraft Identification Capability"
        definition
            Aircraft identification capability.
        element 1
            table
                0: No capability
                1: Capable

    SQCAP "Squitter Capability"
        definition
            Squitter capability.
        element 1
            table
                0: No capability
                1: Capable

    SICAP "Surveillance Identifier Code Capability"
        definition
            Surveillance identifier code capability.
        element 1
            table
                0: No capability
                1: Capable

    GICBCAP "Common Usage GICB Capability"
        definition
            Common usage GICB capability.
        element 1
            table
                0: No capability
                1: Capable

    HYB "ACAS Hybrid Surveillance"
        definition
            ACAS hybrid surveillance capability.
        element 1
            table
                0: No capability
                1: Capable

    RA "ACAS Resolution Advisory"
        definition
            ACAS resolution advisory capability.
        element 1
            table
                0: No capability
                1: Capable

    RTCAVER "ACAS RTCA Version"
        definition
            ACAS RTCA version.
        element 2
            unsigned integer

    DTE "DTE Status"
        definition
            Data terminal equipment status array.
        element 16
            raw
